DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Conor Janda\nConor Janda
	 is a rising stand-up comedian known for his clever\, observational humor 
	and engaging storytelling. His comedy draws from everyday life experiences
	\, delivered with a sharp wit and a conversational style that instantly co
	nnects with audiences. \nHe has built a loyal following through his relata
	ble material and consistent performances at clubs and festivals across the
	 country. Fans can expect a tight\, well-crafted set full of laughs and cl
	ever observations. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime
	: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacrame
	nto\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+
	 / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
	 is one of the most beloved comedy venues in Northern California. Located 
	at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, this intimate club has hosted some of th
	e biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe venue features a coz
	y\, club-style layout with general admission and preferred seating options
	\, a full bar\, and the classic two-drink minimum. Every seat offers a gre
	at view of the stage\, and the warm atmosphere makes for a perfect night o
	ut. Parking is available in the surrounding shopping center lot. \nWhat to
	 Expect\nThis is a solo headline stand-up performance by Conor Janda. Addi
	tional shows are available July 16–17\, so check for your preferred date a
	nd time. Expect an evening of sharp\, engaging comedy in an intimate club 
	setting. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTick
	ets range from approximately $28 – $46 (all-in pricing\, fees included bef
	ore taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliat
